2 marks – Describes a hyperlink type and its use on the club site (e.g. internal link from Home to Fixtures; email link to the secretary; external link to the league site)
1 mark – Names a type only

for each change (2 x 2 marks)
2 marks – Describes a technique and how it fixes the problem (e.g. menu table becomes a single column at phone width so no sideways scrolling)
1 mark – States a change

for each strategy (2 x 2 marks)
2 marks – Describes a strategy linked to the documentary
1 mark – Names a strategy

for each resource (2 x 2 marks)
2 marks – Describes a specific management strategy for the resource
1 mark – States a strategy

for each tool (2 x 2 marks)
2 marks – Describes a tool and the evidence it gives
1 mark – Names a tool
